{
  "_note": "近 24 小时请求(traffic / threats 卡 + 域名页块)。生成器 gen_cloudflare.py;小时桶的时区处理见其文件头。入参 zoneId/zoneName,为空回落账号第一个域名。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_cacheIn",
        "value": "${cache}"
      },
      "_note": "入参先落地(§9.5 #3:方法参数里的 ${} 看不见 flow 入参)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_cache",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${_cacheIn},0)]"
      },
      "_note": "1 = 首页块(读缓存);组件不传 = 0。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_t0",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_zk",
        "value": "${zoneId}"
      },
      "_note": "入参先落地,键表达式里才看得见(§9.5 #3)。无域名参数的流里恒空,不影响。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_ck",
        "value": "$[connect::(c.cf.zone.,${_zk},_t)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "_hit",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${_ck}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_hitTs",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${_hit.ts},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "页面有缓存 → 整段跳过(连接都不建);组件 / 无缓存 → 真取数。取数体里的 fail_unless 失败即终止整条流,所以走到 data.set 的一定是取到了的。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${_cache},1),if::(gt::(${_hitTs},0),0,1),1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "cred",
          "action": "credential.state",
          "params": {
            "id": "cf"
          },
          "_note": "只回 bound / unbound / expired(不回本体)。用来分清「没连接」与「连着但这一轮取不到」:断网时两发请求都为空,光看响应分不出来。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "zid",
            "value": "${zoneId}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "zname",
            "value": "${zoneName}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "$[if::(eq::(${zid},),1,0)]"
          },
          "_note": "没指定域名 → 取账号里第一个兜底。未绑凭证时这一发根本不会发出(宿主抛 credential_required)。",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "zr",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/zones?per_page=1&status=active",
                "method": "GET",
                "formatType": "json",
                "header": {
                  "User-Agent": "Numable",
                  "Accept": "application/json"
                },
                "credential": "cf"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "zid",
                "value": "${zr.result[0].id}"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "zname",
                "value": "${zr.result[0].name}"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "have",
            "value": "$[if::(eq::(${zid},),0,1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_now",
            "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_tzL",
            "value": "$[calc::(formatDate::(${_now},HH)*60+formatDate::(${_now},mm))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_tzM",
            "value": "$[floor::(calc::(${_now}/60000))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_tzD",
            "value": "$[floor::(calc::(${_now}/86400000))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_tzX",
            "value": "$[calc::(${_tzL}-(${_tzM}-${_tzD}*1440))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_tzO",
            "value": "$[if::(gt::(${_tzX},840),calc::(${_tzX}-1440),if::(lt::(${_tzX},-720),calc::(${_tzX}+1440),${_tzX}))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "tzMs",
            "value": "$[calc::(${_tzO}*60000)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_sinceMs",
            "value": "$[calc::(${_now}-${tzMs}-50*3600000)]"
          },
          "_note": "下界 = 50 小时前(按 UTC 落到整点)。⚠️ 免费档 1h 桶的查询窗**不能超过 3 天**:2026-10-08 前用「3 天前 00:00Z」,一过中午就超 3 天,GraphQL 回 errors(code quota)、零个桶,卡上一直是 0。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "sinceD",
            "value": "$[formatDate::(${_sinceMs},yyyy-MM-dd)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "sinceH",
            "value": "$[formatDate::(${_sinceMs},HH)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "${have}"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "body",
                "value": "{\"query\":\"{viewer{zones(filter:{zoneTag:\\\"${zid}\\\"}){httpRequests1hGroups(limit:48,filter:{datetime_geq:\\\"${sinceD}T${sinceH}:00:00Z\\\"},orderBy:[datetime_DESC]){dimensions{datetime} sum{requests threats}}}}}\"}"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "resp",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/graphql",
                "method": "POST",
                "formatType": "json",
                "header": {
                  "Content-Type": "application/json",
                  "User-Agent": "Numable",
                  "Accept": "application/json"
                },
                "body": "${body}",
                "credential": "cf"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "_b",
                "value": "1"
              },
              "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "gerr",
                "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${resp.errors[0].message},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"
              },
              "_note": "GraphQL 体内错误(查询超配额 / 字段不存在 / 无权限):照样 200,只能读 errors[]。"
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "got",
                "value": "$[if::(eq::(${resp},),0,1)]"
              },
              "_note": "响应回来了吗。未绑/被拒时请求不发,resp 为空。⚠️ 紧跟 request 之后的第一个 set 读不到响应(晚一拍合并)—— 这一条本身就是屏障,下面的键才读得到。"
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "g",
                "value": "${resp.data.viewer.zones[0].httpRequests1hGroups}"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "n",
                "value": "$[length::(${g})]"
              }
            },
            {
              "op": "set",
              "props": {
                "key": "p0",
                "value": "$[calc::(parseDate::(subString::(${g[0].dimensions.datetime},0,10),yyyy-MM-dd)+subString::(${g[0].dimensions.datetime},11,13)*3600000+subString::(${g[0].dimensions.datetime},14,16)*60000)]"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "q0",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${g[0].sum.requests},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "a0",
            "value": "$[round::(calc::((${p0}-calc::(parseDate::(subString::(${g[0].dimensions.datetime},0,10),yyyy-MM-dd)+subString::(${g[0].dimensions.datetime},11,13)*3600000+subString::(${g[0].dimensions.datetime},14,16)*60000))/3600000))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "w0",
            "value": "$[if::(lt::(0,findNotEmpty::(${n},0)),if::(lt::(${a0},24),1,0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "v0",
            "value": "$[if::(lt::(0,findNotEmpty::(${n},0)),if::(ge::(${a0},24),if::(lt::(${a0},48),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "q1",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${g[1].sum.requests},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "a1",
            "value": "$[round::(calc::((${p0}-calc::(parseDate::(subString::(${g[1].dimensions.datetime},0,10),yyyy-MM-dd)+subString::(${g[1].dimensions.datetime},11,13)*3600000+subString::(${g[1].dimensions.datetime},14,16)*60000))/3600000))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "w1",
            "value": "$[if::(lt::(1,findNotEmpty::(${n},0)),if::(lt::(${a1},24),1,0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "v1",
            "value": "$[if::(lt::(1,findNotEmpty::(${n},0)),if::(ge::(${a1},24),if::(lt::(${a1},48),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "q2",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${g[2].sum.requests},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "a2",
            "value": "$[round::(calc::((${p0}-calc::(parseDate::(subString::(${g[2].dimensions.datetime},0,10),yyyy-MM-dd)+subString::(${g[2].dimensions.datetime},11,13)*3600000+subString::(${g[2].dimensions.datetime},14,16)*60000))/3600000))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "w2",
            "value": "$[if::(lt::(2,findNotEmpty::(${n},0)),if::(lt::(${a2},24),1,0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "v2",
            "value": "$[if::(lt::(2,findNotEmpty::(${n},0)),if::(ge::(${a2},24),if::(lt::(${a2},48),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "q3",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${g[3].sum.requests},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "a3",
            "value": "$[round::(calc::((${p0}-calc::(parseDate::(subString::(${g[3].dimensions.datetime},0,10),yyyy-MM-dd)+subString::(${g[3].dimensions.datetime},11,13)*3600000+subString::(${g[3].dimensions.datetime},14,16)*60000))/3600000))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "w3",
            "value": "$[if::(lt::(3,findNotEmpty::(${n},0)),if::(lt::(${a3},24),1,0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "v3",
            "value": "$[if::(lt::(3,findNotEmpty::(${n},0)),if::(ge::(${a3},24),if::(lt::(${a3},48),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "q4",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${g[4].sum.requests},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "a4",
            "value": "$[round::(calc::((${p0}-calc::(parseDate::(subString::(${g[4].dimensions.datetime},0,10),yyyy-MM-dd)+subString::(${g[4].dimensions.datetime},11,13)*3600000+subString::(${g[4].dimensions.datetime},14,16)*60000))/3600000))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "w4",
            "value": "$[if::(lt::(4,findNotEmpty::(${n},0)),if::(lt::(${a4},24),1,0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "v4",
            "value": "$[if::(lt::(4,findNotEmpty::(${n},0)),if::(ge::(${a4},24),if::(lt::(${a4},48),1,0),0),0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "q5",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${g[5].sum.requests},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
